# Fail-closed build context: only bytes explicitly consumed by the ClayVerse image
# are sent to the Docker/OCI builder. Local state, credentials, receipts, tests,
# VCS metadata and unrelated research material stay outside the build context.
*
!Dockerfile
!requirements.txt
!SOURCE_LOCK.json
!build/
!build/install_pinned_xterm.py
!build/install_pinned_claude.py
!build-assets/
!build-assets/entityos/
!build-assets/entityos/.keep
!build-assets/entityos/EntityOS
!clayverse/
!clayverse/**
# Retired alternate product runtimes stay as repository evidence/tests but never enter
# the final image. The only live surface is service -> terminal_gateway -> tmux/Claude.
clayverse/adapters.py
clayverse/api.py
clayverse/engine.py
clayverse/inference_protocol.py
clayverse/terminal.py
!policy/
!policy/**
!runtime_CLAUDE.md
!entityos.lock.json
